1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Ninth Episode
The Broken Idols
Broken Doll

15
00:02:05,707 --> 00:02:06,920
Whoa!

16
00:02:08,009 --> 00:02:09,280
It's Sapphire's castle!

17
00:02:30,180 --> 00:02:31,180
Whoa!

18
00:02:31,660 --> 00:02:32,720
It's the gallows!

19
00:02:33,124 --> 00:02:34,124
Why is that there?

20
00:02:35,060 --> 00:02:35,433
Huh?

21
00:02:35,624 --> 00:02:36,717
Is something going on?

22
00:02:51,420 --> 00:02:53,480
Has Sapphire not come yet?

23
00:02:53,916 --> 00:02:54,776
Oh, but—

24
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:55,800
No, you mustn't!

25
00:02:56,130 --> 00:03:00,180
These clothes are to be worn for the 900-Year Tower Festival!

26
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:01,280
Indeed!

27
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:06,700
It is all thanks to that tower that Silverland has been protected for 900 years!

28
00:03:06,725 --> 00:03:09,420
Therefore, you must be properly dressed!

29
00:03:09,860 --> 00:03:12,380
Yees... Are we done yet?

30
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:13,900
What do you mean "yet"?

31
00:03:14,084 --> 00:03:16,619
But I haven't even eaten my meal yet!

32
00:03:17,145 --> 00:03:18,420
Oh, that's right!

33
00:03:19,920 --> 00:03:20,920
What's this?

34
00:03:22,015 --> 00:03:26,600
To commemorate 900 years ago, you are to eat the exact same meal as in the old days.

35
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:34,320
You must eat it properly!

36
00:03:35,903 --> 00:03:39,953
In imitation of those impoverished times, you must not take more than a single bite!

37
00:03:39,978 --> 00:03:41,320
Well then, let us go—

38
00:03:46,855 --> 00:03:50,341
Your Majesty, I have brought Prince Sapphire.

39
00:03:50,366 --> 00:03:51,780
The prince, you say?
Where is he?

40
00:03:51,805 --> 00:03:53,800
Ah, he vanished into thin air!

41
00:03:54,394 --> 00:03:55,394
Unbelievable!

42
00:03:56,070 --> 00:03:58,680
We cannot possibly start such an important ceremony like this!

43
00:03:58,855 --> 00:04:00,800
Hurry up and look for Lord Sapphire!

44
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:01,933
I'm coming now!

45
00:04:02,940 --> 00:04:03,840
Sapphire!

46
00:04:03,940 --> 00:04:04,940
Sapphire!

47
00:04:07,610 --> 00:04:09,573
Father, good morning!

48
00:04:11,110 --> 00:04:13,342
Even though we went to all the trouble of dressing you properly...

49
00:04:13,366 --> 00:04:14,541
 Huh?

50
00:04:29,738 --> 00:04:30,706
Be quiet!

51
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:34,400
It looks like something from a cheap play!

52
00:04:37,220 --> 00:04:38,640
Sapphire, stop that!

53
00:04:39,876 --> 00:04:41,934
Ah, yes, Mother...

54
00:04:47,646 --> 00:04:56,520
O noble ancestors of Silverland, today we perform the cleaning and upkeep of the demon-repelling idol...

55
00:05:36,060 --> 00:05:37,801
...Are we ready?

56
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:51,160
Come now, please enter one by one!

57
00:05:51,973 --> 00:05:52,973
There!

58
00:05:54,690 --> 00:05:56,600
Phew, it's so high...

59
00:05:58,780 --> 00:06:03,533
Now, now, everyone, as you were told, go up and down the stairs in order!

60
00:06:10,726 --> 00:06:11,086
Huh?

61
00:06:11,620 --> 00:06:13,080
There's an idol here!

62
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:14,873
What a funny face!

63
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:17,753
Don't touch it, Sapphire!

64
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:23,200
Sapphire, you must not touch or move the sacred idol as you please!

65
00:06:24,930 --> 00:06:26,800
Now, open the windows!

66
00:06:26,905 --> 00:06:30,559
Everyone, please open the windows and begin cleaning!

67
00:06:40,420 --> 00:06:43,940
Whenever I see it, it has such a fine face, so fitting for warding off evil spirits!

68
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:45,541
Indeed, truly...

69
00:06:45,565 --> 00:06:48,080
Huh, is something like this really a demon repeller?

70
00:06:53,340 --> 00:06:55,180
Fool, don't look down!

71
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:56,500
You must not look down!

72
00:07:28,366 --> 00:07:29,360
Sapphire!

73
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:31,860
Well done, Sapphire!

74
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,040
My thanks to you!

75
00:07:34,300 --> 00:07:35,513
You fool!

76
00:07:36,020 --> 00:07:39,100
Tell me, what punishment awaits one who breaks the idol?!

77
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:39,760
Yes!

78
00:07:40,095 --> 00:07:43,000
If you scratch the idol's face, your own face will be slashed!

79
00:07:43,500 --> 00:07:48,840
If you injure its hand, it eats your face; if you injure its foot, it eats your foot!

80
00:07:50,170 --> 00:07:53,220
And if you chop off its head, you will be executed!

81
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:53,760
That's right!

82
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:54,400
Exactly!

83
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:57,100
Even if you are daughters of nobility like yourselves!

84
00:07:57,420 --> 00:07:59,520
Nylon, don't say such terrifying things!

85
00:07:59,545 --> 00:08:00,520
Have some pity on them!

86
00:08:00,521 --> 00:08:05,186
Oh, Your Highness! Thank you so very, very much for saving the idol...

87
00:08:05,210 --> 00:08:06,419
Here! I'm returning it!

88
00:08:17,340 --> 00:08:19,760
The idol is safe and sound.

89
00:08:21,430 --> 00:08:23,540
I'll leave the rest to you, Nylon!

90
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:25,880
It's Tink!

91
00:08:29,570 --> 00:08:30,760
I wonder what's inside?

92
00:08:30,900 --> 00:08:32,366
Let me take a look!

93
00:08:38,732 --> 00:08:40,732
I don't see anything.

94
00:08:57,025 --> 00:08:58,080
Who's there!

95
00:09:00,637 --> 00:09:01,455
Whoa! Easy there!

96
00:09:01,900 --> 00:09:02,900
Alright!

97
00:09:02,925 --> 00:09:05,260
Miss, snap out of it!

98
00:09:06,560 --> 00:09:07,413
Who is it!

99
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,480
The one who knows the details is...

100
00:09:08,505 --> 00:09:09,580
Me!

101
00:09:16,636 --> 00:09:17,276
Come here!

102
00:09:17,300 --> 00:09:18,038
Nylon!

103
00:09:18,062 --> 00:09:18,300
Yes

104
00:09:18,413 --> 00:09:19,799
No, No, No, No!

105
00:09:20,900 --> 00:09:22,300
I don't want to!

106
00:09:24,489 --> 00:09:28,380
Now then, Your Majesty, please put your seal on this death warrant.

107
00:09:29,265 --> 00:09:30,480
On a child like that?

108
00:09:30,795 --> 00:09:33,200
Hmm, well, do as you see fit.

109
00:09:49,260 --> 00:09:50,973
What are you going to do to Tink?!

110
00:09:52,039 --> 00:09:55,419
Tink? You mean that notorious villain who was sentenced to death.

111
00:09:55,443 --> 00:09:56,800
Death sentence?

112
00:09:57,030 --> 00:10:01,260
Well, he broke the demon-warding idol, so it can't be helped.

113
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,120
No way!

114
00:10:10,380 --> 00:10:11,380
Tink!

115
00:10:12,300 --> 00:10:13,300
Damn it!

116
00:10:34,579 --> 00:10:35,980
Mister, please stop!

117
00:10:36,390 --> 00:10:37,390
Get out of my way!

118
00:10:39,170 --> 00:10:41,940
It's because idols like this exist that people are getting killed!

119
00:10:59,949 --> 00:11:00,949
Ah, what a relief.

120
00:11:00,973 --> 00:11:02,180
This is for the best.

121
00:11:04,700 --> 00:11:05,700
What?

122
00:11:05,740 --> 00:11:08,460
Is there another fool who broke an idol?

123
00:11:08,909 --> 00:11:10,100
That is correct.

124
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:12,932
And so, regarding the death warrant, your seal...

125
00:11:12,956 --> 00:11:16,680
Ah, stamp it yourself. It's late and I'm sleepy.

126
00:11:18,340 --> 00:11:19,700
Very well, then.

127
00:11:21,098 --> 00:11:22,780
Won't you prepare my bed?

128
00:11:22,886 --> 00:11:24,040
Yes.

129
00:11:32,459 --> 00:11:33,300
Duralumin.

130
00:11:34,889 --> 00:11:38,466
Duralumin, isn't there some way we can put a stop to this execution?

131
00:11:38,889 --> 00:11:40,640
Is it really acceptable to do such a thing?

132
00:11:40,913 --> 00:11:43,032
If we do not punish the one who broke the idols,

133
00:11:43,056 --> 00:11:47,166
Silverland will suffer a demon's curse for as many idols as were destroyed.

134
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:49,566
If you are fine with that...

135
00:11:49,590 --> 00:11:51,660
No, no, wait, that would also be a big problem.

136
00:11:51,990 --> 00:11:52,990
A very big problem.

137
00:11:53,155 --> 00:11:54,120
Well then...

138
00:11:54,457 --> 00:11:55,343
Proceed!

139
00:12:26,799 --> 00:12:28,120
Oh, she's being marched off to execution?!

140
00:12:29,020 --> 00:12:29,640
Mother!

141
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:30,640
Duralumin!

142
00:12:30,810 --> 00:12:32,800
What on earth... what on earth is the meaning of this?

143
00:12:32,965 --> 00:12:36,060
Why is my s-s-son being executed?

144
00:12:36,109 --> 00:12:38,880
Your Majesty, I received proper authorization.

145
00:12:39,070 --> 00:12:42,620
Lady Sapphire broke 30 idols.

146
00:12:43,020 --> 00:12:51,020
That many... Sapphire, what in the world... what in the world have you done?

147
00:12:52,189 --> 00:12:54,679
Sapphire, you have done something terrible...

148
00:13:00,775 --> 00:13:03,340
Darn it, if only I could get untied...

149
00:13:05,580 --> 00:13:08,240
Now then, I shall respectfully carry out the execution.

150
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:52,720
Sapphire!

151
00:13:52,780 --> 00:13:53,360
Sapphire!

152
00:13:53,800 --> 00:13:54,460
Sapphire!

153
00:13:54,820 --> 00:13:57,020
Ah, Queen, Queen, please stop!

154
00:13:57,335 --> 00:13:58,906
Nylon, please let me go!

155
00:13:59,405 --> 00:14:00,640
You mustn't go, Your Majesty!

156
00:14:04,409 --> 00:14:07,019
Prince Sapphire, we have been expecting you.

157
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:09,133
Oh, are you going to execute this child?

158
00:14:10,439 --> 00:14:12,140
Poor thing, Daddy.

159
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:12,640
Shut up!

160
00:14:12,820 --> 00:14:15,940
Watch what I do carefully and become a fine executioner!

161
00:14:16,085 --> 00:14:18,640
Tink, the Knight of the Ribbon didn't last long, did he?

162
00:14:18,980 --> 00:14:19,980
Yeah.

163
00:14:20,100 --> 00:14:21,580
Here, throw the rope.

164
00:14:21,733 --> 00:14:22,880
Here you go!

165
00:14:25,579 --> 00:14:26,820
Prince Sapphire, run away!

166
00:14:27,469 --> 00:14:28,469
Thank You!

167
00:14:28,887 --> 00:14:30,887
Don't stop, Sapphire!

168
00:14:34,209 --> 00:14:36,840
Prince Sapphire has done something reckless!

169
00:14:37,280 --> 00:14:38,280
What?

170
00:14:38,489 --> 00:14:40,179
Dear, Sapphire is...

171
00:14:40,203 --> 00:14:41,960
Sa-Sa-Sapphire...

172
00:14:42,340 --> 00:14:43,920
Leave it to me.

173
00:14:44,469 --> 00:14:45,278
Alright, but...

174
00:14:45,302 --> 00:14:47,700
Prince Sapphire has done something reckless!

175
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:49,620
Everyone, shoot him down with bows!

176
00:14:49,780 --> 00:14:51,213
Duralamin, you mustn't!

177
00:14:51,855 --> 00:14:55,673
Which is more important: the life of a single prince, or Silverland?

178
00:15:00,615 --> 00:15:01,780
Sapphire, hurry!

179
00:15:15,249 --> 00:15:17,280
Your Highness, please stand on the execution platform!

180
00:15:17,539 --> 00:15:21,940
Please think of how grieved your parents would be if you met such a shameful death!

181
00:15:22,400 --> 00:15:23,400
Damn it!

182
00:15:23,760 --> 00:15:25,520
You're really set on killing me no matter what, aren't you!

183
00:15:37,270 --> 00:15:39,786
What's happening?!

184
00:15:46,659 --> 00:15:47,659
Your Highness!

185
00:15:48,260 --> 00:15:49,260
Sapphire!

186
00:15:49,960 --> 00:15:50,960
Mother!

187
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:52,080
Father!

188
00:16:02,060 --> 00:16:03,100
What's going on!

189
00:16:03,699 --> 00:16:05,614
The women are saying they're going to

190
00:16:05,638 --> 00:16:08,040
break the idol to save Princess Sapphire!

191
00:16:09,300 --> 00:16:11,240
I won't let that happen, stop them!

192
00:16:11,539 --> 00:16:12,920
Won't you stop too!

193
00:16:12,980 --> 00:16:13,640
Shut up!

194
00:16:13,850 --> 00:16:16,020
Don't interfere with what I'm doing!

195
00:16:17,364 --> 00:16:18,237
Mom...

196
00:16:19,188 --> 00:16:21,441
for us too, in this... Shut up!

197
00:16:28,725 --> 00:16:29,725
What should we do!

198
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:36,380
Someone, stop, you!

199
00:16:36,500 --> 00:16:37,020
What is it!

200
00:16:37,275 --> 00:16:38,275
You good-for-nothing!

201
00:16:45,020 --> 00:16:45,820
Damn it!

202
00:16:45,980 --> 00:16:46,820
The execution is called off!

203
00:16:46,900 --> 00:16:48,240
Capture the women!

204
00:17:03,500 --> 00:17:05,800
The women are smarter than the men!

205
00:17:06,220 --> 00:17:08,680
Are you saying something like this is worse than a demon!

206
00:17:38,240 --> 00:17:39,240
I don't care!

207
00:17:39,314 --> 00:17:41,184
Send them to the scaffold,

208
00:17:41,208 --> 00:17:43,200
whether there are thousands or tens of thousands of them!

209
00:17:43,489 --> 00:17:44,726
Not on my watch!

210
00:17:48,366 --> 00:17:49,286
Mephisto!

211
00:17:50,429 --> 00:17:51,460
Is that Mephisto?!

212
00:17:51,914 --> 00:17:54,833
You tried to kill Sapphire without my permission, Duralumin!

213
00:17:55,554 --> 00:17:59,760
However, if you give me Sapphire's boy's heart, I might forgive you!

214
00:18:00,235 --> 00:18:01,200
Forgive me!

215
00:18:01,240 --> 00:18:03,280
Sapphire's heart belongs to you!

216
00:18:03,759 --> 00:18:06,720
However, that angel Tink is with her, so I can't get near!

217
00:18:07,359 --> 00:18:09,040
Leave Sapphire alone!

218
00:18:09,340 --> 00:18:09,700
All right!

219
00:18:09,889 --> 00:18:11,560
Let's take only Sapphire out of the cell!

220
00:18:11,584 --> 00:18:12,900
That should do!

221
00:18:13,819 --> 00:18:14,860
Very well!

222
00:18:18,099 --> 00:18:19,340
What business do you have with me?

223
00:18:19,899 --> 00:18:21,820
The King is requesting your presence.

224
00:18:22,360 --> 00:18:22,775
All right!

225
00:18:22,800 --> 00:18:23,320
Lead the way!

226
00:18:23,624 --> 00:18:24,680
Sapphire, are you okay?

227
00:18:24,681 --> 00:18:28,066
Since Father is calling for you, he must be calling off the execution!

228
00:18:45,419 --> 00:18:46,560
Wait, aren't those the gallows?!

229
00:18:49,300 --> 00:18:50,300
Your Highness!

230
00:18:50,414 --> 00:18:52,320
Even if you try to run, you cannot escape!

231
00:18:52,569 --> 00:18:55,000
For you are a person sentenced to death!

232
00:18:55,140 --> 00:18:55,766
No way!

233
00:18:55,909 --> 00:18:57,520
Hearing you say that just makes me want to run away even more!

234
00:19:00,280 --> 00:19:00,893
Hup!

235
00:19:01,132 --> 00:19:03,093
It is time to atone for your child's misconduct!

236
00:19:03,260 --> 00:19:03,899
Yes, sir!

237
00:19:06,260 --> 00:19:06,940
Your Highness!

238
00:19:07,264 --> 00:19:08,340
Forgive me.

239
00:19:08,544 --> 00:19:11,480
I must capture you!

240
00:19:35,189 --> 00:19:36,189
What a strange wind!

241
00:19:58,869 --> 00:19:59,940
Damn it!

242
00:20:00,159 --> 00:20:01,720
This must be the work of a demon!

243
00:20:11,180 --> 00:20:13,640
The idols are...MEPHISTO!

244
00:20:14,385 --> 00:20:15,540
All right!

245
00:20:18,200 --> 00:20:18,720
Heheh!

246
00:20:18,740 --> 00:20:19,740
I popped out!

247
00:20:21,980 --> 00:20:23,140
Prince Sapphire!

248
00:20:23,425 --> 00:20:24,425
Running away is useless!

249
00:20:24,860 --> 00:20:27,040
Today, I will take your boy's heart!

250
00:20:38,080 --> 00:20:39,540
Sapphire, can you fight?

251
00:20:44,349 --> 00:20:45,349
You damn idol!

252
00:20:45,480 --> 00:20:46,480
Come on!

253
00:21:00,129 --> 00:21:01,129
Mephisto!

254
00:21:01,749 --> 00:21:04,220
Not being fooled by my magic—impressive, as expected!

255
00:21:04,820 --> 00:21:05,884
Now, Your Highness,

256
00:21:05,908 --> 00:21:08,726
shall I take your boy's heart!

257
00:21:09,460 --> 00:21:10,460
No!

258
00:21:11,940 --> 00:21:12,940
Damn it!

259
00:21:29,439 --> 00:21:30,439
Sapphire!

260
00:21:30,489 --> 00:21:31,580
It's all over for you now!

261
00:21:31,999 --> 00:21:33,260
Your fighting ends here!

262
00:21:33,989 --> 00:21:36,060
Now, look into my eyes!

263
00:21:36,494 --> 00:21:37,800
Stare closely!

264
00:21:41,980 --> 00:21:42,980
Darn it!

265
00:21:43,700 --> 00:21:44,700
Hmm?

266
00:21:45,939 --> 00:21:47,740
Mephisto, I found you!

267
00:21:48,024 --> 00:21:49,573
Get out of here, you!

268
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:50,820
Go away!

269
00:21:50,933 --> 00:21:52,000
Go!

270
00:21:52,160 --> 00:21:52,746
Hmm?

271
00:21:52,900 --> 00:21:53,900
Brat, stay back!

272
00:21:54,140 --> 00:21:55,140
Don't come near me!

273
00:21:56,200 --> 00:21:57,200
Go away!

274
00:21:57,339 --> 00:21:59,473
If you don't leave, take this!

275
00:21:59,766 --> 00:22:00,700
I'm leaving!

276
00:22:00,780 --> 00:22:01,780
Fine, I'll just leave, alright?!

277
00:22:01,854 --> 00:22:03,120
Don't get any closer than that!

278
00:22:03,304 --> 00:22:04,560
My whole body is going numb!

279
00:22:18,930 --> 00:22:19,930
Sapphire!

280
00:22:27,409 --> 00:22:29,380
Sapphire, I'm so glad you're safe!

281
00:22:30,169 --> 00:22:33,000
Mother, I'm sorry for making you worry!

282
00:22:33,299 --> 00:22:34,373
Sapphire...

283
00:22:34,397 --> 00:22:36,233
But Mother,

284
00:22:36,257 --> 00:22:38,773
there's nothing more hilarious than this!

285
00:22:51,329 --> 00:22:52,960
There really is nothing funnier than this!

286
00:22:53,140 --> 00:22:53,475
Huh?

287
00:22:53,500 --> 00:22:54,060
Nylon!

288
00:22:54,500 --> 00:22:54,715
Huh?

289
00:22:54,740 --> 00:22:55,740
Well, yes...

290
00:22:56,079 --> 00:22:58,993
That demon guy smashed the warding charm against demons!

291
00:22:59,294 --> 00:23:00,920
So that charm was a total fake!

292
00:23:01,164 --> 00:23:02,220
It was complete nonsense!

293
00:23:02,221 --> 00:23:03,670
Huh? Right?

294
00:23:04,170 --> 00:23:06,360
Duralumin, it's funny, isn't it!

295
00:23:09,120 --> 00:23:10,480
If it's funny, laugh!

296
00:23:10,945 --> 00:23:11,945
Laugh!

297
00:23:13,220 --> 00:23:15,713
I wish a hole would open up so I could crawl into... oh, there is one!

298
00:23:46,449 --> 00:23:49,240
There are still plenty of absurd rules in this kingdom!

